# SAM build output — regenerated by `sam build`, no reason to version it.
.aws-sam

# samconfig.toml is deliberately NOT ignored: StripeSecretKey and OpenAiApiKey
# are declared NoEcho in template.yaml, so SAM never writes them there, and
# keeping it tracked documents the stack name and region for anyone cloning.
# If a sensitive parameter is ever added without NoEcho, ignore this file.
